### Safe Wrapper (Optional)

If you prefer a non-throwing version that returns an error object instead:

```javascript
function classifyAgeSafe(age) {
  try {
    return { result: classifyAge(age), error: null };
  } catch (err) {
    return { result: null, error: err.message };
  }
