### Key Design Decisions

| Decision | Reason |
|---|---|
| `typeof age !== "number"` | Rejects strings, booleans, `null`, `undefined`, objects — even `"25"` |
| `Number.isNaN(age)` | `NaN` has `typeof "number"`, so needs a separate check |
